      "string_id": "news_main_new_1044",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I cannot get to Sidorovich, folks! I've been knocking at his door for an hour already, but no response. Maybe something is wrong...",
      "JA_current": "I cannot get to Sidorovich, folks! I've been knocking at his door for an hour already, but no response. Maybe something is wrong...",
      "JA_new": "なあみんな、シドロヴィッチに会えない！　もう1時間もドアを叩いてるのに、返事がない。何かあったのかも……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "news_main_new_script_text:news_main_new_1045#1",
      "source_table": "news_main_new_script_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\news_main_new_script_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3135,
      "string_id": "news_main_new_1045",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No way! Nothing can ever be wrong with our good old Sid! It's because some guy who used to be an electrical engineer came by and installed a new lock for him, and Sidorovich hasn't gotten used to it yet. Keep waiting.",
      "JA_current": "No way! Nothing can ever be wrong with our good old Sid! It's because some guy who used to be an electrical engineer came by and installed a new lock for him, and Sidorovich hasn't gotten used to it yet. Keep waiting.",
      "JA_new": "まさか！　あのシドに限って何かあるわけないだろ！　電気技師だった奴が来て、新しい鍵を取り付けたんだ。シドロヴィッチがまだ開け方に慣れてないだけさ。待ってな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "news_main_new_script_text:news_main_new_1046#1",
