      "source_xml_line": 3186,
      "string_id": "news_main_new_1062",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Where do I start... The lad just looks strange - an odd face, barefoot, wearing only some blue jeans...",
      "JA_current": "Where do I start... The lad just looks strange - an odd face, barefoot, wearing only some blue jeans...",
