      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\news_main_new_script_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3189,
      "string_id": "news_main_new_1063",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": ", either you're a complete rookie idiot or one lucky bastard!!! Listen to me, man! Run away right now and pray he hasn't spotted you! And God forbid you ever run into this \"lad\" ever again!",
      "JA_current": ", either you're a complete rookie idiot or one lucky bastard!!! Listen to me, man! Run away right now and pray he hasn't spotted you! And God forbid you ever run into this \"lad\" ever again!",
      "JA_new": "、お前がとんでもない新米か、よっぽど運のいい奴かのどっちかだ！！！　よく聞け！　今すぐ逃げろ。そいつに見つかってないことを祈るんだ！　二度とその「男」に出くわさないよう、神に祈れ！",
