      "string_id": "news_main_new_1066",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I don't care about any fish... I was passing by some swamp and got overwhelmed by this desire to just sit a bit with a fishing rod in hand... Like I used to as a child, with my dad... I'd sell my \"Soul\" for some fishing tackle...",
      "JA_current": "I don't care about any fish... I was passing by some swamp and got overwhelmed by this desire to just sit a bit with a fishing rod in hand... Like I used to as a child, with my dad... I'd sell my \"Soul\" for some fishing tackle...",
      "JA_new": "魚なんかどうでもいい……沼地のそばを通ったら、釣り竿を持って少し座りたい気分になったんだ……子どもの頃、親父と釣りをしたみたいにさ……釣り道具のためなら«ソウル»だって差し出すよ……",
